@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Edge" {
  [Browser] --> [nginx]
}

package "Backend" {
  [NodeJS (BFF)] --> [HAPI FHIR]
  [NodeJS (BFF)] --> [Keycloak]
  [HAPI FHIR] --> [Keycloak]
}

Browser -down-> nginx : TLS
nginx -right-> NodeJS (BFF) : HTTP(s)
NodeJS (BFF) -right-> HAPI FHIR : Forward user token or exchanged token
NodeJS (BFF) ..> Keycloak : token-exchange / client_credentials
HAPI FHIR ..> Keycloak : JWKS / (introspection optional)

note right of NodeJS (BFF)
  Validates JWT (JWKS cached)
  Enforces domain/resource policies
  Logs audit info
end note

note right of HAPI FHIR
  Validates JWT (JWKS)
  Enforces FHIR policies (scopes/consent)
end note
@enduml